/* Windows resource script: application icon.
 *
 * The .ico is rendered from web/favicon.svg; regenerate it with
 *   make icon
 * (or: python tools/make_icon.py web/favicon.svg src/filedrop.ico)
 *
 * Icon ID 1 is what Explorer, the taskbar and shortcuts pick up first.
 */
1 ICON "src/filedrop.ico"
